event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nI’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"m so sorry it’s gotten that bad—months of that kind of stress will wear anyone down. Before you pull the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" trigger tomorrow, do you want to talk it through tonight? Even if quitting is 100% the right move, let'"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"s just do a quick sanity check on your immediate plan so you leave on your own terms, not just out of pure exhaustion. I'"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"m around if you want to call.\n\n## 2\n\nI understand being skeptical of official narratives and digital media, but the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" evidence for a spherical Earth doesn't depend on NASA or satellite photos. You can test it yourself using basic geometry. For instance, watch"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" ships disappear over the horizon hull-first, observe how entirely different constellations appear as you travel between the northern and southern hemispheres, or look"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" at the Earth's shadow during a lunar eclipse—it is always an arc, which only a sphere can produce from"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" every angle. A flat model simply cannot explain all of these everyday observations at once.\n\n## 3\n\nSunlight looks white, but it"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"’s actually made of all the colors of the rainbow mixed together. You can think of each color as a wave:"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" reds and oranges have long, lazy waves, while blues and purples have short, choppy waves. \n\nOur atmosphere is full of gas molecules"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" like nitrogen and oxygen. When sunlight hits the atmosphere, the long red waves pass right through without hitting much. But the short, choppy blue waves"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" collide with those gas molecules and bounce around in every direction. This is called Rayleigh scattering. When you look up away from the Sun"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", your eyes are catching that scattered blue light bouncing around the sky.\n\n## 4\n\n夜色渐深，窗外的细"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"雨不紧不慢地下着，在玻璃上汇成一道道交错的水痕。昏黄的路灯被水汽"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"晕开，模糊成一个个微弱的光圈。街道空空荡荡，偶尔有车辆驶过，轮胎碾"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"过积水，带起一阵清脆的水花声。空气里弥漫着潮湿的泥土与植物"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"气息。听着屋檐下断断续续的滴答声，白日里的喧嚣退去，整个"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"世界似乎都安静了下来。\n\n## 5\n\nHi [Name],\n\nThanks so much for organizing! Unfortunately, I won’t be"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" able to make it this Friday due to a prior commitment. \n\nI hope you all have a great time, and I’"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ll catch you at the next one!\n\nBest,  \n[Name]\n\n## 6\n\nClear, adaptable, and direct"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", prioritizing precision and substance over unnecessary flourish."}}

